## Development

```bash
# Run tests
pytest tests/unit tests/integration -v

# Lint + format
ruff check src tests
ruff format src tests

# Type check
mypy src --strict

# Load test (requires k6 + a running service)
k6 run -e BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080 tests/load/k6_optimize.js
```

